  "slug": "a-happy-day",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/23410_a-happy-day.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "My name is Dawei and I am a student. Now I am studying Chinese in China. I have a good friend named Martin. We are all college students, and we all like China. We like to eat Chinese food. The buns, dumplings and noodles are all delicious. We also like to drink Chinese tea. Today is Saturday, we don't have classes. At ten o'clock in the morning, we went to the mall to buy clothes. In the afternoon we went to see a movie. We cook our own meals in the evening. We are very happy today."
  ],
  "english_full": "My name is Dawei and I am a student. Now I am studying Chinese in China. I have a good friend named Martin. We are all college students, and we all like China. We like to eat Chinese food. The buns, dumplings and noodles are all delicious. We also like to drink Chinese tea. Today is Saturday, we don't have classes. At ten o'clock in the morning, we went to the mall to buy clothes. In the afternoon we went to see a movie. We cook our own meals in the evening. We are very happy today.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Меня зовут Давэ́й, и я студе́нт. Ныне я изуча́ю кита́йский язы́к в Кита́е. У меня есть хоро́ший друг по имени Ма́ртин. Мы все студе́нты ко́лледжа, и мы все любим Китай. Мы любим ку́шать кита́йскую пи́щу. Паровы́е бу́лочки, пельме́ни и лапша́ - всё это вку́сно. Мы то́же любим пить кита́йский чай. Сегодня суббо́та, у нас нет зда́ний. В де́сять часо́в у́тром мы пошли в молл, чтобы купи́ть оде́жду. Послеобе́денное вре́мя мы пошли на фильм. Ве́чером мы готовим свою еду́. Мы се́годня очень счастли́вы."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Menya zovut Davéy, i ya studént. Nýnye ya izucháyu kitáyskiy yazýk v Kitáye. U menya yest' khoróshiy drug po ímeni Mártin. My vse studénty kóldezha, i my vse lyubim Kitáy. My lyubim kúshat' kitáyskiyu píshchu. Parovýe bulóchki, pel'méni i lapshá - vsyo éto vkúsno. My tózhe lyubim pit' kitáyskiy chay. Segódnya subbóta, u nas nyet zdániy. V dyésiát' chasov útrom my poshli v moll, chtoby kupít' odézhdu. Posleobédennoye vréya my poshli na film. Véchером my gotovim svoyu edú. My syegódnya óchen' schastlívy."
  ],
